00:13:31.102 --> 00:13:32.436
We'll figure something out.

244
00:13:32.437 --> 00:13:34.563
- Hey, booze!
- [In-ho] Oh. Alcohol...

245
00:13:34.564 --> 00:13:36.607
[Arron] Drink some booze
and you'll be fine!

246
00:13:36.608 --> 00:13:39.026
Alcohol's the only reason I'm still human.

247
00:13:39.027 --> 00:13:41.570
- It's true...
- [Arron] We'll figure it out together!

248
00:13:41.571 --> 00:13:43.532
- [beeps]
- [Young-man] <i>Booze?</i>

249
00:13:44.282 --> 00:13:45.741
<i>That doesn't make any sense.</i>

250
00:13:45.742 --> 00:13:47.285
Oh, wait. Hold on!

251
00:13:48.119 --> 00:13:50.704
Actually Arron Park
just keeps drinking alcohol

252
00:13:50.705 --> 00:13:52.790
and he hasn't mutated yet!

253
00:13:52.791 --> 00:13:55.043
Sergeant please drink some alcohol! Yeah?

254
00:13:56.002 --> 00:13:57.586
- [beeps]
- [Young-man] <i>You know,</i>

255
00:13:57.587 --> 00:14:01.591
[chuckles] <i>as crazy as that sounds
I believe you.</i>

256
00:14:02.884 --> 00:14:07.931
<i>But I feel like</i> [sighs]
<i>it's already a little too late for me.</i>

257
00:14:12.185 --> 00:14:13.019
<i>Make sure...</i>

258
00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:15.689
<i>Everyone survives.</i>

259
00:14:18.733 --> 00:14:23.405
<i>This is my final order as acting
squad commander.</i>

260
00:14:24.239 --> 00:14:26.365
- Hey...
- No! Wait, wait!

261
00:14:26.366 --> 00:14:28.200
Sergeant Kim! Wait, please!

262
00:14:28.201 --> 00:14:29.119
[beep]

263
00:14:39.879 --> 00:14:40.714
Young-man...

264
00:14:42.757 --> 00:14:43.592
[sighs]

265
00:14:47.679 --> 00:14:48.972
[woman] Come. It's safe.

266
00:14:52.434 --> 00:14:54.060
Be careful. Watch your step.

267
00:14:56.688 --> 00:14:57.522
Be quiet!

268
00:15:07.991 --> 00:15:08.825
This way.

269
00:15:14.414 --> 00:15:15.624
It's over here! Hurry!

270
00:15:20.754 --> 00:15:21.921
[Young-joo gasps]

271
00:15:24.466 --> 00:15:27.302
Are these zombies or people?

272
00:15:27.844 --> 00:15:31.222
[woman] Given the amount of blood
on the floor, definitely human.

273
00:15:31.931 --> 00:15:34.225
They were killed
by the thugs that chased you.

274
00:15:38.146 --> 00:15:39.272
So heartbreaking.

275
00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:46.695
- Are you all right?
- What?

276
00:15:46.696 --> 00:15:49.074
Oh... I'm not sure.

277
00:15:54.496 --> 00:15:55.330
Follow me.

278
00:16:00.752 --> 00:16:02.712
Don't worry. It's safe here, I promise.

279
00:16:07.008 --> 00:16:09.135
We'll wait here, so that you can rest up

280
00:16:10.303 --> 00:16:11.554
and head to the station.

281
00:16:13.765 --> 00:16:16.141
- Any luck, Ra In-ho?
- [In-ho] Still looking sir!

282
00:16:16.142 --> 00:16:17.893
[Soo-jeong] Oh, come on! [grunts]

283
00:16:17.894 --> 00:16:19.437
[In-ho] Gosh! Nothing here.

284
00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.233
[sighs, gasps]

285
00:16:25.944 --> 00:16:26.778
Huh?

286
00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:34.911
[beeps]

287
00:16:36.454 --> 00:16:38.706
- [In-ho] I found them!
- [Gye-young] You found them?

288
00:16:38.707 --> 00:16:41.459
- [Soo-jeong] Really? Amazing!
- [Jae-yoon] Great work! Thank god!

289
00:16:42.168 --> 00:16:43.002
[grunts]

290
00:16:45.213 --> 00:16:46.214
Oh, I'll take it.

291
00:16:47.507 --> 00:16:49.175
- Let's go. Start it, hurry.
- Wait!

292
00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:52.512
Kyung-sik. He's not here yet.

293
00:16:54.889 --> 00:16:55.724
Oh...

294
00:16:57.016 --> 00:16:58.475
He just...

295
00:16:58.476 --> 00:17:00.061
Ran off by himself somewhere.

296
00:17:01.563 --> 00:17:03.606
And you only told us about it right now?

297
00:17:05.066 --> 00:17:07.819
[sighs] Shit.

298
00:17:11.573 --> 00:17:14.992
Let's get going. Drive to Suseo Station.

299
00:17:14.993 --> 00:17:16.035
Yeah, let's go.

300
00:17:34.137 --> 00:17:36.139
[snarling]

301
00:17:38.099 --> 00:17:40.435
[car alarms blaring]

302
00:17:47.066 --> 00:17:47.901
[thud]

303
00:17:49.402 --> 00:17:51.404
[snarling]

304
00:18:09.088 --> 00:18:10.089
[sighs]

305
00:18:16.429 --> 00:18:17.263
[sighs]

306
00:18:25.605 --> 00:18:26.439
[whimpers]

307
00:18:29.567 --> 00:18:31.693
[Young-man] This kid got an award
at training camp.

308
00:18:31.694 --> 00:18:33.196
- Whoa!
- He's a rockstar!

309
00:18:34.447 --> 00:18:36.032
Hey Hyung-bae, what's this guys name?

310
00:18:36.574 --> 00:18:38.450
- Private Hwang Kyung-sik
- Wow.

311
00:18:38.451 --> 00:18:41.287
Corporal Kim, your son's an ace too?
That's not fair.

312
00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.247
With the luck we've got

313
00:18:43.248 --> 00:18:45.499
we'll end up with washed-up geezers
for our sons.

314
00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:48.043
Huh? Please don't jinx me,
that's uncalled for!

315
00:18:48.044 --> 00:18:49.503
Kyung-sik you said?

316
00:18:49.504 --> 00:18:51.547
Private Hwang Kyung-sik!

317
00:18:51.548 --> 00:18:54.216
This is my son now.
Nobody messes with him.

318
00:18:54.217 --> 00:18:55.802
- Ah-huh!
- Okay, then.

319
00:18:56.344 --> 00:18:57.345
Now we're family.

320
00:18:57.846 --> 00:18:59.304
Private Hwang Kyung-sik!

321
00:18:59.305 --> 00:19:00.431
Got it, right!

322
00:19:08.481 --> 00:19:11.359
Private Hwang Kyung-sik.
Thanks for the meal, sir!

323
00:19:12.318 --> 00:19:13.278
Eat up now, son.

324
00:19:14.112 --> 00:19:14.946
[groans, blows]

325
00:19:15.864 --> 00:19:17.115
All right, I've finished.

326
00:19:18.199 --> 00:19:19.200
Yeah, here.

327
00:19:19.951 --> 00:19:22.661
- Private Hwang Kyung-Sik.
- They're perfect sir.

328
00:19:22.662 --> 00:19:24.289
Ah, no need to say thank you.

329
00:19:25.081 --> 00:19:28.209
A father has to make sure his son
is presentable on his first leave.

330
00:19:28.835 --> 00:19:31.671
And those, I made sure to get
the sharpest creases ever.

331
00:19:32.463 --> 00:19:34.007
- [chuckles]
- Oh, also...

332
00:19:34.841 --> 00:19:35.842
Here. Take it.

333
00:19:36.593 --> 00:19:39.344
- No, it's okay.
- Please, take it.

334
00:19:39.345 --> 00:19:40.722
Your birthday is coming up.

335
00:19:41.431 --> 00:19:42.973
Treat yourself to a good dinner.

336
00:19:42.974 --> 00:19:44.516
[chuckles] You don't have to.

337
00:19:44.517 --> 00:19:46.435
Just take it already.

338
00:19:46.436 --> 00:19:48.897
- My arm's tired. You little shit.
- I can't take it, sir.

339
00:19:51.232 --> 00:19:52.066
[sighs]

340
00:19:54.444 --> 00:19:55.612
I really appreciate it, sir.

341
00:19:58.907 --> 00:19:59.741
Thank you, Dad.

342
00:20:06.664 --> 00:20:08.666
[whimpering]

343
00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:16.424
[gunshot]

344
00:20:21.721 --> 00:20:22.555
[sighs]

345
00:21:03.429 --> 00:21:05.431
[breathing heavily]

346
00:21:08.935 --> 00:21:09.769
Shit.

347
00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:12.105
[gasps]

348
00:21:16.901 --> 00:21:19.153
[panting]

349
00:21:35.586 --> 00:21:38.130
- [phone trilling]
- Come on. Come on, come on.

350
00:21:38.131 --> 00:21:40.465
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Hello? Young-joo?</i>
- [exclaims] Mom!

351
00:21:40.466 --> 00:21:42.926
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>My Young-joo!</i>
- Are you okay?

352
00:21:42.927 --> 00:21:45.429
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Where are you?</i>
- You're still alive!

353
00:21:45.430 --> 00:21:46.972
[Young-joo's mom sobbing]

354
00:21:46.973 --> 00:21:48.433
<i>Are you okay, sweetie?</i>

355
00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:50.226
<i>Are you okay?</i>

356
00:21:50.685 --> 00:21:53.145
<i>- Where are you?</i>
- At a train station.

357
00:21:53.146 --> 00:21:56.107
- I need to get out of here!
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Young-joo!</i>

358
00:21:56.691 --> 00:21:57.692
<i>Are you safe there?</i>

359
00:21:59.360 --> 00:22:00.819
<i>You're not in danger, right?</i>

360
00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:03.071
I'm hiding deep
in the Express Bus Terminal.

361
00:22:03.072 --> 00:22:04.614
I'm safe, don't worry!

362
00:22:04.615 --> 00:22:07.034
[Young-joo's mom] <i>Why didn't you
go where Jae-yoon is?</i>

363
00:22:07.035 --> 00:22:08.411
It's a really long story.

364
00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:12.623
But I was rescued by a lady who works
at the train station so I'm safe.

365
00:22:13.041 --> 00:22:14.792
Just promise that you'll stay home.

366
00:22:15.835 --> 00:22:17.962
[Young-joo's mom] <i>What are you
doing there?</i>

367
00:22:18.588 --> 00:22:21.090
I... I went looking for Jae-yoon but...

368
00:22:21.591 --> 00:22:23.968
Things got really crazy
and I ended up here.

369
00:22:24.802 --> 00:22:27.637
[Young-joo's mom] <i>Are you all right?
How are you going to come home?</i>

370
00:22:27.638 --> 00:22:29.182
Everything's okay, really.

371
00:22:29.724 --> 00:22:32.809
In the morning I'll head to Suseo Station
to come and get you.

372
00:22:32.810 --> 00:22:35.730
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Where? Young-joo?</i>
- [woman shushes]

373
00:22:36.856 --> 00:22:38.107
[Young-joo's mom] <i>Young-joo!</i>

374
00:22:38.858 --> 00:22:40.609
[Young-joo's mom] <i>Is everything okay?</i>

375
00:22:40.610 --> 00:22:43.820
Hey mom! I need to get going now.
Just... please stay home.

376
00:22:43.821 --> 00:22:44.905
[Young-joo's mom] <i>Okay.</i>

377
00:22:44.906 --> 00:22:47.533
- Don't worry about me. Yeah.
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Be careful.</i>

378
00:22:50.328 --> 00:22:53.331
- So sorry. Well...
- Mmm-hmm. No worries. Really.

379
00:22:53.956 --> 00:22:56.918
The phone is working now.
You should be able to call home.

380
00:22:58.753 --> 00:22:59.587
I'm okay.

381
00:23:00.421 --> 00:23:01.255
Maybe later.

382
00:23:02.006 --> 00:23:03.091
That's sweet, though.

383
00:23:07.053 --> 00:23:07.886
SEOUL METRO
PARK EUN-CHAE

384
00:23:07.887 --> 00:23:09.514
- Park Eun-chae.
- Yeah?

385
00:23:10.181 --> 00:23:12.390
Um, you just saved my life.

386
00:23:12.391 --> 00:23:15.103
I wanna make sure
I never forget your name.

387
00:23:15.353 --> 00:23:16.562
SEOUL METRO
PARK EUN-CHAE

388
00:23:17.522 --> 00:23:18.356
Yeah.

389
00:23:19.273 --> 00:23:20.108
They call me,

390
00:23:20.775 --> 00:23:21.609
Park Eun-chae.

391
00:23:22.026 --> 00:23:23.569
- Park Eun-chae.
- And your name?

392
00:23:24.612 --> 00:23:25.988
I am Kang Young-joo.

393
00:23:27.281 --> 00:23:29.074
[Eun-chae] Nice to meet you, Young-joo.

394
00:23:29.075 --> 00:23:31.160
[engine whirring]

395
00:23:34.997 --> 00:23:36.999
[snarling]

396
00:23:46.467 --> 00:23:48.552
[In-ho] What's that? It's a dead end!

397
00:23:48.553 --> 00:23:52.014
- Turn around! U-turn! U--
- [Gye-young] Wait... Hold on!

398
00:23:53.307 --> 00:23:55.226
Ah, shit. This way's blocked too.

399
00:23:56.352 --> 00:23:59.354
Sorry, guys. I should have told you
but I'm a bad driver.

400
00:23:59.355 --> 00:24:00.439
- Hold up!
- Huh?

401
00:24:02.441 --> 00:24:03.985
Maybe I should just stay here.

402
00:24:05.027 --> 00:24:06.779
- [all] What?
- I think that...

403
00:24:07.864 --> 00:24:09.281
My time has run out.

404
00:24:09.282 --> 00:24:11.283
- Huh.
- [Soo-jeong] What? Manager...

405
00:24:11.284 --> 00:24:12.827
- You're sober?
- [Soo-jeong] What?

406
00:24:14.078 --> 00:24:17.247
- [sniffs] Aww, shit!
- [Gye-young] What are you gonna do?

407
00:24:17.248 --> 00:24:18.206
Alcohol.

408
00:24:18.207 --> 00:24:19.333
We need alcohol now!

409
00:24:20.126 --> 00:24:22.879
There has to be, a bar
or convenience store.

410
00:24:23.963 --> 00:24:25.213
[Jae-yoon] Chinese restaurant.

411
00:24:25.214 --> 00:24:26.131
JIN PALACE

412
00:24:26.132 --> 00:24:28.633
Huh? Th... There has to be alcohol.

413
00:24:28.634 --> 00:24:29.718
- [Soo-jeong] Oh!
- Oh!

414
00:24:29.719 --> 00:24:31.428
- [In-ho] Get out! hurry!
- Come on, guys!

415
00:24:31.429 --> 00:24:32.597
[Soo-jeong] Let's go.

416
00:24:34.640 --> 00:24:36.392
[Arron] Booze. Booze!

417
00:24:41.731 --> 00:24:42.565
[gasps]

418
00:24:44.483 --> 00:24:45.693
[Jae-yoon] Arron Park...

419
00:24:47.195 --> 00:24:48.029
Are you okay?

420
00:24:50.573 --> 00:24:51.407
[sighs]

421
00:24:53.242 --> 00:24:54.076
[sighs]

422
00:24:55.328 --> 00:24:56.579
I think we're safe here.

423
00:25:09.425 --> 00:25:11.176
[phone trilling]

424
00:25:11.177 --> 00:25:12.094
Young-joo, please.

425
00:25:12.803 --> 00:25:13.638
Answer me.

426
00:25:14.680 --> 00:25:16.348
[clicks, beeping]

427
00:25:16.349 --> 00:25:17.850
[sighs] Shit!

428
00:25:23.064 --> 00:25:24.065
- [clatter]
- [gasps]

429
00:25:25.149 --> 00:25:26.150
Soo-jeong! [gasps]

430
00:25:27.109 --> 00:25:28.818
It's pork! Look sweet and sour!

431
00:25:28.819 --> 00:25:30.613
- Hell, yeah!
- [exclaims]

432
00:25:31.239 --> 00:25:32.781
- Oh! Gye-Young!
- Have some!

433
00:25:32.782 --> 00:25:33.866
- [sighs]
- [chuckles]

434
00:25:35.785 --> 00:25:37.244
- Mmm...
- [chuckles]

435
00:25:37.245 --> 00:25:39.037
- Wow! Oh!
- So good. Mmm!

436
00:25:39.038 --> 00:25:40.163
- That sauce?
- Yeah!

437
00:25:40.164 --> 00:25:41.623
- Like it?
- Yes, I do.

438
00:25:41.624 --> 00:25:43.291
- So do I. Heck yes.
- [chuckles]

439
00:25:43.292 --> 00:25:45.877
- Try it!
- This counts as our Chinese dinner date.

440
00:25:45.878 --> 00:25:47.629
[chuckles]

441
00:25:47.630 --> 00:25:48.756
Seriously?

442
00:25:49.674 --> 00:25:51.132
Are you messing with me?

443
00:25:51.133 --> 00:25:53.970
Everyone right now just needs
to relax and decompress.

444
00:25:54.595 --> 00:25:56.305
- Hmm!
- My stress reliever is humor.

445
00:25:56.722 --> 00:25:57.556
So is food.

446
00:25:58.224 --> 00:25:59.224
Ah!

447
00:25:59.225 --> 00:26:00.142
Okay.

448
00:26:01.727 --> 00:26:03.604
Then, you are now,

449
00:26:04.063 --> 00:26:07.357
officially allowed to crack jokes
and cheer up all of us.

450
00:26:07.358 --> 00:26:08.650
- Got it?
- Got it!

451
00:26:08.651 --> 00:26:09.568
[chuckles]

452
00:26:10.069 --> 00:26:11.320
- Oh?
- Jjamppong broth.

453
00:26:11.779 --> 00:26:14.991
Hell, yeah! This looks delicious!

454
00:26:18.619 --> 00:26:19.453
Huh?

455
00:26:20.621 --> 00:26:21.455
Hmm?

456
00:26:22.331 --> 00:26:23.165
What's this?

457
00:26:24.458 --> 00:26:26.002
[gasps] Oh, my God!

458
00:26:26.419 --> 00:26:28.838
Mmm. Settle down! Seriously!

459
00:26:29.422 --> 00:26:31.464
- Miss Soo-Jeong. Is this your Instagram?
- Huh?

460
00:26:31.465 --> 00:26:34.884
Why are you calling me Miss Soo-jeong?
You're actually older.

461
00:26:34.885 --> 00:26:36.469
- Wow! Wow!
- Just say Soo-jeong.

462
00:26:36.470 --> 00:26:37.929
- I'm sorry!
- Mmm-hmm.

463
00:26:37.930 --> 00:26:38.848
Soo-jeong!

464
00:26:39.307 --> 00:26:41.266
[both laugh]

465
00:26:41.267 --> 00:26:43.643
You really are a bit of a weirdo,
aren't you?

466
00:26:43.644 --> 00:26:44.729
Thank you so much!

467
00:26:45.646 --> 00:26:47.647
[gulping]

468
00:26:47.648 --> 00:26:49.317
[exhales]

469
00:26:49.817 --> 00:26:50.651
[sighs]

470
00:26:50.901 --> 00:26:52.986
{\an8}I'm going drink myself to death.

471
00:26:52.987 --> 00:26:54.404
{\an8}ENDURE
HANGOVER REMEDY

472
00:26:54.405 --> 00:26:55.323
{\an8}[Arron] Huh?

473
00:26:56.657 --> 00:26:57.742
- [clicks]
- [grunts]

474
00:26:59.410 --> 00:27:00.745
[grunts] Huh?

475
00:27:03.247 --> 00:27:06.167
You cannot allow yourself
to give into despair, Arron Park.

476
00:27:07.084 --> 00:27:08.210
You cannot die on us.

477
00:27:09.170 --> 00:27:11.922
Never, ever give up,
no matter what happens!

478
00:27:15.843 --> 00:27:16.677
Okay.

479
00:27:18.054 --> 00:27:19.263
Appreciate it, Private.

480
00:27:22.099 --> 00:27:23.309
I'm still in this fight.

481
00:27:29.357 --> 00:27:30.191
[chuckles]

482
00:27:31.609 --> 00:27:34.612
I'm giving you some ginseng for energy.
Energy-juice.

483
00:27:35.071 --> 00:27:37.156
- We're gonna become invincible!
- Screw it.

484
00:27:38.991 --> 00:27:40.201
[beeps, clacks]

485
00:27:41.786 --> 00:27:42.787
[dial tone]

486
00:27:45.873 --> 00:27:47.875
[phone trilling]

487
00:27:52.296 --> 00:27:53.130
Ah!

488
00:27:57.385 --> 00:27:58.719
I'll be home soon.

489
00:28:04.141 --> 00:28:05.975
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Young-joo?</i>
- Hello?

490
00:28:05.976 --> 00:28:07.894
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Huh?</i>
- Oh, Mrs. Kang!

491
00:28:07.895 --> 00:28:09.312
[Young-joo's mom] <i>Oh!</i> [gasps]

492
00:28:09.313 --> 00:28:11.689
Hello, Mrs. Kang.
It's Jae-yoon, I'm Young-joo's...

493
00:28:11.690 --> 00:28:14.360
[Young-joo's mom] <i>Jae-yoon!
Is everything all right?</i>

494
00:28:14.985 --> 00:28:16.361
<i>Are you safe where you are?</i>

495
00:28:16.362 --> 00:28:18.780
Yes. I'm doing all right, are you safe?

496
00:28:18.781 --> 00:28:21.492
[Young-joo's mom] <i>I'm okay.
I locked myself at home.</i>

497
00:28:22.284 --> 00:28:24.245
<i>Young-joo just called me.
She's looking for you!</i>

498
00:28:24.954 --> 00:28:29.333
<i>She said she's hiding with a transit
worker at the Express Bus Terminal.</i>

499
00:28:30.126 --> 00:28:33.295
<i>I've tried calling back
but the lines are disconnected!</i>

500
00:28:33.879 --> 00:28:36.382
- Express Bus Terminal? You sure?
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Yes.</i>

501
00:28:36.841 --> 00:28:40.969
<i>She said she would rest up for the night
and try to come get me in the morning.</i>

502
00:28:40.970 --> 00:28:42.387
[gasping]

503
00:28:42.388 --> 00:28:45.891
<i>It just feels too dangerous. Jae-yoon!</i>

504
00:28:46.392 --> 00:28:48.060
<i>- Can you go get her?</i>
- Young-joo...

505
00:28:48.769 --> 00:28:50.980
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Jae-yoon?</i>
- Yes, ma'am.

506
00:28:51.981 --> 00:28:54.524
Don't worry, I'll go to her right away.
I promise you.

507
00:28:54.525 --> 00:28:56.609
And whatever you do, don't go outside.

508
00:28:56.610 --> 00:28:59.529
Just swear to me that no matter what,
you'll stay inside.

509
00:28:59.530 --> 00:29:00.823
[Young-joo's mom] <i>All right.</i>

510
00:29:01.657 --> 00:29:04.951
<i>Please be very careful Jae-yoon.
It's so dangerous!</i>

511
00:29:04.952 --> 00:29:07.495
No need to worry yourself.
I've trained, you know?

512
00:29:07.496 --> 00:29:10.207
- Don't you worry, all right?
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>Okay. Good.</i>

513
00:29:10.833 --> 00:29:12.500
<i>Oh, oh, good.</i>

514
00:29:12.501 --> 00:29:14.586
Wait for us and we'll come get you.

515
00:29:14.587 --> 00:29:16.881
- [Young-joo's mom] <i>All right. I'll wait.</i>
- [sighs]

516
00:29:19.008 --> 00:29:20.009
- [sighs]
- [In-ho] Huh?

517
00:29:21.010 --> 00:29:22.177
- A kid.
- [Arron] Huh?

518
00:29:22.178 --> 00:29:23.386
[In-ho] There's a kid!

519
00:29:23.387 --> 00:29:24.305
We need to bring--

520
00:29:32.897 --> 00:29:33.898
[sighs]

521
00:29:43.824 --> 00:29:44.825
[sobbing]

522
00:29:55.878 --> 00:29:57.922
[Eun-chae] It seems
like things have calmed down.

523
00:29:58.756 --> 00:30:00.633
Do you think we should get going now?

524
00:30:02.593 --> 00:30:03.969
- Right now?
- Mmm-hmm.

525
00:30:04.720 --> 00:30:06.388
All we need to do is open the shutter.

526
00:30:07.014 --> 00:30:09.390
There's a control room
not far down the hallway.

527
00:30:09.391 --> 00:30:11.809
If we can connect
the subway's emergency power line,

528
00:30:11.810 --> 00:30:13.102
we should be able to open it.

529
00:30:13.103 --> 00:30:15.856
We always keep a backup generator
for emergencies.

530
00:30:18.692 --> 00:30:21.195
- I'm gonna go and do it.
- Oh! I'll go with you.

531
00:30:24.949 --> 00:30:25.783
Young-joo.

532
00:30:27.034 --> 00:30:30.955
Do you ever wonder why pilots, never eat
the same meal as the rest of the crew?

533
00:30:32.373 --> 00:30:33.207
Huh?

534
00:30:36.460 --> 00:30:38.796
I'm saying it's safer
if we don't go together.

535
00:30:40.381 --> 00:30:42.967
I'm gonna head to the control room,
and open the shutter.

536
00:30:48.264 --> 00:30:51.684
I'll activate all the breakers.
That should get the lights turned on.

537
00:30:52.351 --> 00:30:53.561
Do you see that shutter?

538
00:30:54.186 --> 00:30:55.019
[Young-joo] Yes.

539
00:30:55.020 --> 00:30:58.107
When that goes up, mission accomplished.
Understand?

540
00:31:03.654 --> 00:31:05.613
I need something I can use as a weapon.

541
00:31:05.614 --> 00:31:07.324
Um... Let's see...

542
00:31:08.409 --> 00:31:09.243
This'll work.

543
00:31:16.792 --> 00:31:19.169
Wait here for a bit.
I'll be right back, okay.

544
00:31:27.469 --> 00:31:29.471
[breathing heavily]

545
00:31:33.350 --> 00:31:34.602
[coughs]

546
00:31:38.939 --> 00:31:40.858
Get in here.
What are you standing there for?

547
00:31:41.734 --> 00:31:43.736
You know your family is waiting for you.

548
00:31:50.534 --> 00:31:52.661
I'm clear about what needs to happen next.

549
00:31:54.788 --> 00:31:56.206
I need to rescue Young-joo.

550
00:31:58.042 --> 00:31:59.251
It's been a true honor.

551
00:32:00.085 --> 00:32:01.211
I've only made it this far,

552
00:32:02.087 --> 00:32:03.172
thanks to all of you.

553
00:32:04.340 --> 00:32:06.008
Now, it's time for us to go home.

554
00:32:09.720 --> 00:32:11.180
Let's go get our loved ones.

555
00:32:14.600 --> 00:32:15.809
We need to protect them.

556
00:32:17.186 --> 00:32:19.188
[engine whirring]

557
00:32:19.521 --> 00:32:21.523
JIN PALACE

558
00:32:39.750 --> 00:32:41.752
[panting]

559
00:33:10.155 --> 00:33:10.989
Shit.

560
00:33:14.118 --> 00:33:15.828
[clanging]

561
00:33:24.211 --> 00:33:26.213
[whimpering]

562
00:33:41.937 --> 00:33:43.939
- [clanging]
- [grunting]

563
00:33:53.282 --> 00:33:55.284
[muffled snarls]

564
00:34:06.837 --> 00:34:07.671
- [thud]
- [gasps]

565
00:34:08.589 --> 00:34:10.465
Ugh! Zombie head!

566
00:34:10.466 --> 00:34:11.383
[clatters]

567
00:34:12.468 --> 00:34:14.052
- [snarls]
- [gasps]

568
00:34:17.765 --> 00:34:18.974
[Jae-yoon] Ugh, damn it.

569
00:34:23.187 --> 00:34:24.021
Young-joo.

570
00:34:25.063 --> 00:34:25.898
Kang Young-joo.

571
00:34:29.651 --> 00:34:30.486
Young-joo.

572
00:34:31.278 --> 00:34:32.112
Ugh, shit.

573
00:34:47.878 --> 00:34:49.880
[snarling]

574
00:34:53.383 --> 00:34:54.550
[gasps] No, no, no!

575
00:34:54.551 --> 00:34:55.469
No! Stop!

576
00:34:55.803 --> 00:34:57.346
Back off! Get away! [grunting]

577
00:35:01.350 --> 00:35:02.308
[groans]

578
00:35:02.309 --> 00:35:03.602
[grunting]

579
00:35:12.694 --> 00:35:14.196
Young-joo!

580
00:35:18.158 --> 00:35:19.535
Kang Young-joo!

581
00:35:24.164 --> 00:35:25.457
Young-joo!

582
00:35:27.292 --> 00:35:28.710
Kang Young-joo!

583
00:35:31.797 --> 00:35:33.090
Young-joo!

584
00:35:34.800 --> 00:35:36.468
Can you hear me Young-joo?

585
00:35:38.720 --> 00:35:40.264
Kang Young-joo!

586
00:35:40.889 --> 00:35:41.932
[gasps]

587
00:35:43.976 --> 00:35:45.143
Jae-yoon!

588
00:35:48.438 --> 00:35:49.481
Lee Jae-yoon!

589
00:35:55.153 --> 00:35:56.280
Young-joo!

590
00:35:58.365 --> 00:35:59.907
[Young-joo] Lee Jae-yoon!

591
00:35:59.908 --> 00:36:00.826
[gasps]

592
00:36:01.535 --> 00:36:03.036
- [Jae-yoon] Young-joo!
- [gasps]

593
00:36:04.288 --> 00:36:05.372
Jae-yoon!

594
00:36:06.039 --> 00:36:07.457
I'm over here!

595
00:36:09.668 --> 00:36:10.502
Young-joo!

596
00:36:11.128 --> 00:36:11.962
[exclaims]

597
00:36:12.629 --> 00:36:14.631
[panting]

598
00:36:15.799 --> 00:36:16.633
[grunts]

599
00:36:17.134 --> 00:36:19.344
I'm coming! Jae-yoon!

600
00:36:22.014 --> 00:36:23.223
Jae-yoon!

601
00:36:26.310 --> 00:36:27.561
- Young-joo-- Whoa!
- [gunshots]

602
00:36:29.021 --> 00:36:29.979
Young-joo!

603
00:36:29.980 --> 00:36:31.815
- [snarls]
- [gunshots]

604
00:36:33.025 --> 00:36:33.859
Young-joo.

605
00:36:34.401 --> 00:36:35.234
[snarling]

606
00:36:35.235 --> 00:36:37.321
[grunting]

607
00:36:42.993 --> 00:36:44.494
- [thuds]
- [groans]

608
00:36:45.454 --> 00:36:46.288
Young-joo.

609
00:36:46.955 --> 00:36:47.788
[snarls]

610
00:36:47.789 --> 00:36:48.707
[gunshot]

611
00:36:51.418 --> 00:36:53.420
[grunting]

612
00:36:55.797 --> 00:36:57.507
Fuck you! Argh!

613
00:36:58.091 --> 00:36:59.676
Assholes! Motherfuckers!

614
00:37:00.427 --> 00:37:02.429
- [grunting]
- [snarling]

615
00:37:04.765 --> 00:37:05.766
Oh, God!

616
00:37:08.352 --> 00:37:09.226
[screams]

617
00:37:09.227 --> 00:37:10.895
Jae-yoon!

618
00:37:10.896 --> 00:37:12.981
[panting]

619
00:37:13.649 --> 00:37:15.651
- [gunshots]
- [Jae-yoon screaming]

620
00:37:17.194 --> 00:37:18.028
[gasps]

621
00:37:18.654 --> 00:37:19.613
Jae-yoon!

622
00:37:22.616 --> 00:37:25.077
Jae-yoon! Jae-yoon!

623
00:37:30.916 --> 00:37:31.749
Young-joo.

624
00:37:31.750 --> 00:37:33.794
[gasps] Jae-yoon!

625
00:37:34.503 --> 00:37:35.337
Ah!

626
00:37:36.004 --> 00:37:36.838
Young-joo.

627
00:37:37.756 --> 00:37:38.590
[gasps]

628
00:37:39.591 --> 00:37:40.842
Jae-yoon!

629
00:37:41.385 --> 00:37:42.386
Young-joo!

630
00:37:45.931 --> 00:37:47.724
Young-joo!

631
00:37:48.725 --> 00:37:50.142
[gasps]

632
00:37:50.143 --> 00:37:52.229
[snarling]

633
00:37:55.023 --> 00:37:55.857
[gasps]

634
00:37:56.858 --> 00:37:59.110
Young... [snarling]

635
00:37:59.111 --> 00:38:00.736
[gasps]

636
00:38:00.737 --> 00:38:02.321
[snarls]

637
00:38:02.322 --> 00:38:04.449
- [gunshot]
- [screams]

638
00:38:20.215 --> 00:38:21.049
Young-joo.

639
00:38:22.843 --> 00:38:23.677
[sighs]

640
00:38:25.554 --> 00:38:26.805
Jae-yoon, it's you!

641
00:38:28.932 --> 00:38:29.766
Young-joo.

642
00:38:30.559 --> 00:38:31.767
[Young-joo whimpers]

643
00:38:31.768 --> 00:38:32.811
Young-joo.

644
00:38:42.279 --> 00:38:43.113
Jae-yoon.

645
00:38:50.328 --> 00:38:51.163
Young-joo.

646
00:38:57.586 --> 00:38:58.420
It's okay now.

647
00:39:02.924 --> 00:39:04.676
What the hell too you so long?

648
00:39:06.636 --> 00:39:08.430
I must look disgusting.

649
00:39:11.433 --> 00:39:12.434
You look beautiful.

650
00:39:20.525 --> 00:39:23.445
- Blood really compliments your eyes.
- [chuckles]

651
00:39:24.112 --> 00:39:25.697
Jae-yoon! [cries]

652
00:39:31.620 --> 00:39:33.914
What took you so long? [crying]

653
00:39:34.331 --> 00:39:35.332
Sorry, Young-joo.

654
00:39:37.000 --> 00:39:38.251
I'm sorry I took so long.

655
00:39:47.302 --> 00:39:48.261
You're safe. Huh?

656
00:39:49.096 --> 00:39:49.930
You're okay.

657
00:39:55.519 --> 00:39:56.353
Come here!

658
00:39:59.606 --> 00:40:01.566
- Stay close to me. Got it?
- Yeah.

659
00:40:02.317 --> 00:40:04.194
Understood. Ah, shit.

660
00:40:08.156 --> 00:40:09.116
[gasps]

661
00:40:11.535 --> 00:40:13.245
- Shit. Wait.
- [gasps]

662
00:40:14.496 --> 00:40:15.330
Hold on!

663
00:40:16.706 --> 00:40:17.707
I have this.

664
00:40:19.000 --> 00:40:21.044
- What's that?
- A weapon.

665
00:40:26.133 --> 00:40:27.509
- [gunshots]
- [screams]

666
00:40:27.843 --> 00:40:28.677
[thuds]

667
00:40:31.054 --> 00:40:32.597
But how?

668
00:40:33.974 --> 00:40:35.976
[grunting]

669
00:40:39.104 --> 00:40:40.105
[gunshot]

670
00:40:41.189 --> 00:40:42.524
[Gye-young] Cover me!

671
00:40:43.066 --> 00:40:43.900
Huh? Huh?

672
00:40:45.068 --> 00:40:47.070
[all grunting]

673
00:40:56.705 --> 00:40:58.039
[gunshots]

674
00:41:04.796 --> 00:41:06.297
[Arron] It's done? All clear?

675
00:41:06.298 --> 00:41:07.840
- [In-ho] Yes!
- [Soo-jeong] Oh!

676
00:41:07.841 --> 00:41:08.925
[all sighing]

677
00:41:10.468 --> 00:41:12.470
[all panting]

678
00:41:18.351 --> 00:41:19.352
[Jae-yoon] Hey...

679
00:41:20.520 --> 00:41:22.730
What are you guys doing here?

680
00:41:22.731 --> 00:41:24.857
The gang decided to aid in the rescue.

681
00:41:24.858 --> 00:41:28.153
There's no way this private
was gonna survive without us.

682
00:41:29.196 --> 00:41:30.197
But your families...

683
00:41:30.822 --> 00:41:32.282
Thankfully, they're all safe.

684
00:41:33.617 --> 00:41:35.868
From now on, we move together.

685
00:41:35.869 --> 00:41:37.620
No ifs, ands or buts about it.

686
00:41:37.621 --> 00:41:40.414
Our odds of survival are higher
if we stay close.

687
00:41:40.415 --> 00:41:42.417
We will rescue each other's families!

688
00:41:43.418 --> 00:41:45.045
Looks like it's our best choice.

689
00:41:45.587 --> 00:41:46.421
Uh...

690
00:41:46.838 --> 00:41:49.174
Hey, who are these people?

691
00:41:53.762 --> 00:41:54.763
They're my friends.

692
00:42:03.021 --> 00:42:03.855
Hey.

693
00:42:05.982 --> 00:42:08.068
Oh, jeez, you're covered in blood.

694
00:42:09.027 --> 00:42:11.488
[Arron] All right, everything's packed.
Let's get going.

695
00:42:12.113 --> 00:42:13.906
- Young-joo.
- Huh?

696
00:42:13.907 --> 00:42:16.408
- I think it's probably time to go.
- Let's wait.

697
00:42:16.409 --> 00:42:18.328
Eun-chae still hasn't come back yet.

698
00:42:18.828 --> 00:42:19.663
Any minute now.

699
00:42:21.331 --> 00:42:24.542
Okay. We're done doing recon.
Coast is clear.

700
00:42:25.293 --> 00:42:27.169
- Was she out on her own?
- [Young-joo] Yeah.

701
00:42:27.170 --> 00:42:29.421
She said she'd open the shutters
and be back.

702
00:42:29.422 --> 00:42:31.716
Food is packed. Everything is good to go.

703
00:42:33.051 --> 00:42:33.885
So...

704
00:42:34.386 --> 00:42:36.387
Uh... How did you get here?

705
00:42:36.388 --> 00:42:38.264
I was rescued by a woman.

706
00:42:38.265 --> 00:42:40.684
I followed her down here.
Her name was Park Eun-chae.

707
00:42:42.143 --> 00:42:46.605
So this Eun-chae personally asked you
to wait for her to lift the shutter?

708
00:42:46.606 --> 00:42:47.899
Yeah, that's right.

709
00:42:49.067 --> 00:42:52.695
How long have those bodies
been laying out in front of the cafe?

710
00:42:52.696 --> 00:42:54.822
- Ah... They were...
- What?

711
00:42:54.823 --> 00:42:57.199
Already laying there when we arrived.

712
00:42:57.200 --> 00:42:59.286
Ah... Gotcha.

713
00:43:01.037 --> 00:43:04.165
Hey, uh, Lee Jae-yoon, can I have a word?

714
00:43:05.667 --> 00:43:06.501
Huh?

715
00:43:08.044 --> 00:43:09.421
Seriously, what's going on?

716
00:43:16.177 --> 00:43:17.803
SEOUL METRO
PARK EUN-CHAE

717
00:43:17.804 --> 00:43:18.930
Park Eun-ch--

718
00:43:21.057 --> 00:43:22.100
[gasps]

719
00:43:23.977 --> 00:43:24.811
Wait...

720
00:43:28.690 --> 00:43:30.734
- Did they just kill her?
- Impossible.

721
00:43:31.318 --> 00:43:34.154
They've been decomposing for quite
a few hours. There's no doubt.

722
00:43:34.779 --> 00:43:36.697
- So this means...
- [Young-joo] What's going on?

723
00:43:36.698 --> 00:43:38.450
[both] Oh! Oh...

724
00:43:38.867 --> 00:43:40.785
- [Young-joo] What's wrong?
- Ah! No, no.

725
00:43:41.661 --> 00:43:42.495
Nothing.

726
00:43:43.246 --> 00:43:44.080
Oh, right.

727
00:43:44.539 --> 00:43:48.083
I didn't tell you that I saw a woman
in a metro uniform running out.

728
00:43:48.084 --> 00:43:50.169
- What?
- And the name tag said Park Eun-chae!

729
00:43:50.170 --> 00:43:51.754
- What's going on?
- Oh, really?

730
00:43:51.755 --> 00:43:53.673
- [Arron] Everything okay?
- Seriously?

731
00:43:54.632 --> 00:43:56.759
Gosh, idiot. Now you're telling us?

732
00:43:56.760 --> 00:43:58.719
- [Young-joo] She survived!
- I'm sorry.

733
00:43:58.720 --> 00:44:00.929
- Young-joo. Come with me.
- [Young-joo] Huh?

734
00:44:00.930 --> 00:44:03.350
- Let's get out of here. Come on.
- [Young-joo] Okay.

735
00:44:07.270 --> 00:44:09.521
- [Soo-jeong] Let's go.
- [Gye-young] All right.

736
00:44:09.522 --> 00:44:11.982
- [In-ho] This way.
- [Gye-young] Do we know which way?

737
00:44:11.983 --> 00:44:13.567
[In-ho] We have to go left.

738
00:44:13.568 --> 00:44:15.861
[Jae-yoon] Ra In-ho,
you better know the way.

739
00:44:15.862 --> 00:44:18.073
[Eun-chae] <i>They call me Park Eun-chae.</i>

740
00:44:48.061 --> 00:44:50.063
[Young-joo gasps]

741
00:44:55.026 --> 00:44:57.028
[muffled snarls]

742
00:45:37.193 --> 00:45:40.029
You can't even imagine
everything that I've been through.

743
00:45:41.781 --> 00:45:43.867
[sighs] It feels like a dream.

744
00:45:48.997 --> 00:45:50.789
{\an8}TO: JAE-YOON - STAY SAFE
YOON JONG-SHIN

745
00:45:50.790 --> 00:45:52.208
But this was real.

746
00:45:54.335 --> 00:45:55.920
Here! It's a present for you.

747
00:45:59.591 --> 00:46:00.425
What is this?

748
00:46:03.136 --> 00:46:04.804
- Where did you get it.
- [chuckles]

749
00:46:05.555 --> 00:46:07.097
It's even got a signature.

750
00:46:07.098 --> 00:46:09.309
And look here. Signed in person.

751
00:46:11.144 --> 00:46:14.022
What? Stop messing with me,
why would you do that?

752
00:46:14.481 --> 00:46:17.274
I'm not making it up.
Your name is right here, Jae-yoon!

753
00:46:17.275 --> 00:46:20.152
Stop playing. How could you meet
Yoon Jong-Shin in all this chaos?

754
00:46:20.153 --> 00:46:23.615
Actually he's back at the metro station.
I even caught his live performance.

755
00:46:25.200 --> 00:46:26.283
[radio announcer speaking]

756
00:46:26.284 --> 00:46:27.910
- Seriously?
- I wouldn't lie to you.

757
00:46:27.911 --> 00:46:31.163
- Yoon Jong-shin kicks ass.
- You seriously got his autograph?

758
00:46:31.164 --> 00:46:32.706
- I swear!
- Seriously though?

759
00:46:32.707 --> 00:46:34.875
[all chattering]

760
00:46:34.876 --> 00:46:39.046
[radio announcer] <i>Due to the emergency,
officials have ordered a lockdown of Seoul</i>

761
00:46:39.047 --> 00:46:40.547
<i>and all surrounding cities.</i>

762
00:46:40.548 --> 00:46:44.635
<i>Anyone in these areas
must immediately proceed to Incheon Port,</i>

763
00:46:44.636 --> 00:46:46.678
<i>where ferries are transporting evacuees</i>

764
00:46:46.679 --> 00:46:49.139
<i>to a secure facility on Jeju Island.</i>

765
00:46:49.140 --> 00:46:53.268
<i>Please disregard previous instructions
directing you to Suseo Station.</i>

766
00:46:53.269 --> 00:46:55.145
<i>I repeat, do not proceed to Suseo station.</i>

767
00:46:55.146 --> 00:46:56.980
[Soo-jeong] The Han River. It's beautiful!

768
00:46:56.981 --> 00:46:59.316
- [Gye-young] How about a break?
- [Soo-jeong] Should we?

769
00:46:59.317 --> 00:47:01.527
- [Young-joo] Let's stop.
- [Jae-yoon] Wanna get out?

770
00:47:01.528 --> 00:47:03.529
- [Arron] I need to stretch.
- [In-ho] Fresh air.

771
00:47:03.530 --> 00:47:06.198
[Jae-yoon] Hey wait. Hey Young-joo!
Careful getting out!

772
00:47:06.199 --> 00:47:07.115
[all sigh]

773
00:47:07.116 --> 00:47:09.952
- [Young-joo] Don't worry, I'm fine.
- [In-ho] I needed this.

774
00:47:09.953 --> 00:47:11.454
[Soo-jeong] It's incredible.

775
00:47:12.205 --> 00:47:14.248
- [Gye-young] Beautiful.
- [In-ho] Oh my...

776
00:47:14.249 --> 00:47:16.917
- [Gye-young] Soo-jeong. Soo-jeong?
- [Soo-jeong] Huh? [chuckles]

777
00:47:16.918 --> 00:47:19.796
[Arron] Man, it's a shit show here too.
What a mess.

778
00:47:22.882 --> 00:47:23.716
[In-ho] Huh?

779
00:47:31.432 --> 00:47:32.267
[exhales]

780
00:47:40.608 --> 00:47:41.442
We're not...

781
00:47:42.026 --> 00:47:43.736
- Huh?
- Ending things, are we?

782
00:47:54.706 --> 00:47:56.624
There's no reason for us to break up.

783
00:47:59.002 --> 00:48:00.002
[Gye-young] I'm hungry.

784
00:48:00.003 --> 00:48:02.087
There's no graduation or military
to worry about.

785
00:48:02.088 --> 00:48:04.881
- [Gye-young] Think we can have our date?
- [Soo-jeong] Stop joking!

786
00:48:04.882 --> 00:48:05.800
That's true.

787
00:48:08.428 --> 00:48:09.262
See...

788
00:48:11.472 --> 00:48:13.433
Even if things never return to normal,

789
00:48:15.768 --> 00:48:17.270
it'll always be the two of us.

790
00:48:20.523 --> 00:48:21.858
No matter what happens,

791
00:48:23.318 --> 00:48:24.152
I will...

792
00:48:25.111 --> 00:48:26.946
Always be there to take care of you.

793
00:48:30.700 --> 00:48:31.534
Actually...

794
00:48:32.702 --> 00:48:34.120
Maybe I'll take care of us.

795
00:48:36.456 --> 00:48:37.290
Please.

796
00:48:38.833 --> 00:48:40.251
- [explosion]
- [Soo-jeong gasps]

797
00:48:42.503 --> 00:48:43.921
- [whooshes]
- [all exclaim]

798
00:48:45.798 --> 00:48:47.299
- Huh?
- That scared me.

799
00:48:47.300 --> 00:48:49.385
[explosions]

800
00:48:50.053 --> 00:48:51.179
Might as well get moving.

801
00:48:51.846 --> 00:48:53.305
- Huh?
- This is not over yet!

802
00:48:53.306 --> 00:48:54.765
[Jae-yoon] Damn it!

803
00:48:54.766 --> 00:48:57.017
- Come on.
- [Gye-young] Soo-jeong, let's go.

804
00:48:57.018 --> 00:48:59.645
- [Young-joo] Jae-yoon, hurry.
- [In-ho] Hurry and get in!

805
00:48:59.646 --> 00:49:02.065
- [Jae-yoon] Be careful!
- [Gye-young] Come on! Watch out!

806
00:49:02.690 --> 00:49:04.441
[Young-joo] Hurry! Get in the car! Now!

807
00:49:04.442 --> 00:49:06.902
[all exclaiming]

808
00:49:06.903 --> 00:49:07.819
- Go!
- Oh, my God!

809
00:49:07.820 --> 00:49:09.112
- Let's get out now!
- Floor it!

810
00:49:09.113 --> 00:49:10.615
- Let's Go!
- To In-ho's house!

811
00:49:11.366 --> 00:49:13.200
- [In-ho] That sounds good!
- [Arron] Let's go!

812
00:49:13.201 --> 00:49:15.035
[In-ho] Ha-yul, daddy's coming!

813
00:49:15.036 --> 00:49:17.121
[closing song playing]

